      "id": "2089076470865854466",
      "title": "Qwen3.8-27B on one DGX Spark: 256 tok/s across 16 parallel requests, 75 tok/s solo",
      "preview_text": "Sixteen requests running in parallel on one 128 GB desktop machine, 256 tokens per second aggregate, 75 for a single stream, up from a stock baseline of 7.88. Only 1.6× of that came from quantizing",
      "cover_media": {
        "id": "QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHP3n+C6WIAAKAAIcWLtsJ1awAAAA",
        "media_id": "2089080855289274368",
        "media_info": {
          "__typename": "ApiImage",
